# Lab 10 — Azure Monitoring / Log Analytics / Troubleshooting

## Goal

Build a small Azure environment and learn how to monitor resources and troubleshoot common failures using:

* Azure Monitor
* Log Analytics Workspace
* Azure Monitor Agent (AMA)
* Data Collection Rule (DCR)
* Metrics
* Alerts
* Basic KQL
* Network troubleshooting

The main goal was to learn **what to check and in what order when a problem occurs**, rather than simply configuring monitoring.

---

